Slide 2 — Problem Statement

🚨 The Problem

Digital payment scams are increasing because attackers use:

Fake customer-care calls

Fake KYC/update messages

QR-code payment tricks

Fake shopping websites

Impersonation

Urgency and pressure tactics

OTP/PIN/CVV requests

Remote-access applications

Fake refund/reward messages


Major Issue

Most existing systems focus on detecting fraud after the transaction happens.

Our idea:

> Stop and analyze the payment before money is sent.




---

Slide 3 — Our Solution

💡 ShieldPay AI

ShieldPay AI is a pre-payment safety checking system.

Instead of:

PAY → FRAUD DETECTED

Our system follows:

PAY NOW

↓

SAFETY CHECK

↓

RISK ANALYSIS

↓

WARNING

↓

VERIFY

↓

DEMO PAYMENT

This gives the user an opportunity to stop before completing a suspicious payment.


---

Slide 4 — How ShieldPay AI Works

🔍 Step-by-Step Process

1. User enters payment information

↓

2. ShieldPay AI analyzes the payment

↓

3. Suspicious signals are identified

↓

4. Risk score is calculated

↓

5. System displays LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH risk

↓

6. User receives an explanation

↓

7. User can verify or block the payment


---

Slide 5 — Scam Signals Detected

🔎 What Does the System Check?

ShieldPay AI looks for multiple suspicious signals:

⚠️ Urgency or pressure

🔐 OTP / PIN / CVV requests

📱 Remote-access or screen-sharing requests

👤 Possible impersonation

💰 Unusual payment requests

🎁 Refund/reward scams

📷 QR-code payment instructions

🔗 Suspicious URLs

🌐 IP-address-based URLs

🔴 Sensitive-action links

💸 High-value transactions



---

Slide 6 — Risk Scoring

📊 Explainable Risk Score

The system generates a score from:

0 → 100

🟢 LOW RISK

Normal transaction with few suspicious indicators.

🟡 MEDIUM RISK

Some suspicious signals are detected.

🔴 HIGH RISK

Multiple strong scam indicators are detected.

The important feature is that the system doesn't only show a score—it also explains why the transaction is considered suspicious.


---

Slide 7 — Example: Fake KYC Scam

🎭 Scenario

User receives:

> “Your bank KYC will expire today. Update immediately or your account will be blocked.”



The message contains:

Urgency

KYC/account pressure

Suspicious link

Request for sensitive information


ShieldPay AI Response

🔴 HIGH RISK

The system displays the suspicious signals before allowing the user to continue.

Recommended action:
Verify the request through the official bank/app instead of following the suspicious message.


